<title>USA: U.S. palladium imports and exports for Feb 1997.</title>
<headline>U.S. palladium imports and exports for Feb 1997.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. palladium imports and exports in grams, not seasonally adjusted, according to the U.S. Commerce Department Thursdsay.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM	  FEB 1997	 JAN 1997	YEAR TO DATE</p>
<p>UNWROUGHT</p>
<p>Imports	    5,318,555     4,831,967	 10,150,522</p>
<p> - from Russia   434,465	   237,800	    672,265</p>
<p>Exports	    1,823,891     1,811,340	  3,635,231</p>
<p>Re-exports	 818,227	   592,646	  1,410,873</p>
<p>Semi-manufactured</p>
<p>Imports	    6,216,089     2,586,240	  8,802,329</p>
<p> - from Russia   5,755,586     1,204,781	  6,960,367</p>
<p>Exports	    1,099,056	 911,319	  2,010,375</p>
<p>Re-exports	 122,680	   100,218	    222,898</p>
<p>Note: 31.1035 grams = one troy ounce</p>
<p>32,150 troy ounces = one tonne</p>
<p>((Clive McKeef, New York Commodities Desk, 212-859-1641))</p>
</text>
